==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The same way that to beat [[Return of Terror]]: take care of the Metal Hippoe by using fast-attackers such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and a lot of meatshields ([[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]]) to defend the base. Using a critical hitter for Metal Hippoe is not necessary since a stack of fast attacking cats should kill him in a short amount of time anyways.

